---
description: Install, sync, and query the local Veta X bookmark library
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user asks to install, sync, scrape, import, organize, or query X
bookmarks with Veta, read `AGENT_INSTALL.md` and follow it completely. Use the
browser already available to Cursor. Do not ask the user to configure browser
tooling, an X developer account, or an AI API key. Register Veta with
`npm run setup -- --agent cursor`.
